type: software
title: "loadbalancer"
abstract: "An HTTP reverse-proxy load balancer in Go, using only the standard library and fsnotify. It has three balancing strategies, active health checks, a passive circuit breaker per backend, retries for idempotent requests, config hot reload, and Prometheus metrics."
